; corpus -- 42 under specs/turbobaby plus specs/agents/turbobaby.t27 -- no contract publishes the
; endpoint-to-gate map: turbobaby/request-identity declares ENDPOINT_TO_GATE_MAP_IS_NOT_OWNED_HERE
; and counts gate call sites over modules instead. What DOES exist, and is recorded so the absence
; is not read wider than it is, are two per-module censuses: turbobaby/loyalty-ledger and
; turbobaby/referral-program each split their OWN routes into ungated and gated counts. A census
; of one module's routes is not a map of the surface, and neither file claims it is.
